WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.640
Mr. President, thank you so much for having us here today and this roundtable.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.040
Antifa is real.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:13.760
Antifa has been around in various iterations for almost 100 years in some instances, going

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.000
back to the Weimar Republic in Germany.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.520
And it's now been just under one month since we saw a far leftist murder Charlie Kirk,

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:31.639
and we saw thousands upon thousands of people, other far leftists and people in positions

00:00:31.639 --> 00:00:38.439
of authority, people like nurses and pilots and doctors and HR departments, celebrating

00:00:38.439 --> 00:00:41.160
the death and the murder of Charlie Kirk.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.639
The sickness that's out there is absolutely real.

00:00:43.639 --> 00:00:46.560
And Mr. President, thank you for mentioning the fact

